WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Settings → Kiosk devices or the location’s Devices tab.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Create a new named kiosk for the intended location and obtain its expiring single-use pairing code.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Open the kiosk page on that device and enter the pairing details.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Test staff PIN access. Revoke the device from management when it should no longer be trusted.
